BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.13 0.18 0.17 rg 1 0 0 1 54 456.0 Tm (determines when braking begins; the final approach uses a low crawl speed and the pulse) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.13 0.18 0.17 rg 1 0 0 1 54 442.0 Tm (generator stops at the exact target count. Keyboard axes can run together; new finite position) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.13 0.18 0.17 rg 1 0 0 1 54 428.0 Tm (moves are accepted while idle.) Tj ET
